<title>HUNGARY: BorsodChem Jan-Sept 96 net profit 4.41 bln.</title>
<headline>BorsodChem Jan-Sept 96 net profit 4.41 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Sept 96    Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 4,532.3   vs   6,319.3</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   5,369.3   vs   6,020.6</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	 4,406.2   vs   4,933.1</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 30,487.8   vs  29,218.9</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    1,023.4   vs   1,043.9</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	19,570.5    vs  16,833.0</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     6,170.1    vs   5,107.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    1,238.3    vs   2,002.8</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    834.0 profit vs 162.2 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	    1,077.5    vs     430.7</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	  243.5    vs     593.0</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	  2.9 profit vs 136.5 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue	   70.2    vs     900.1</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expenditure     67.3    vs   1,037.5</p>
<p>    Taxation			    975.0    vs   1,096.4</p>
<p>NOTE - BorsodChem Rt is a chemical company. The figures are consolidated, are unaudited and are calculated according to Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
